      "message": "Are we allowed to createBond during BLE_ON state ?\nThat sounds not wanted because of \nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/framework/java/android/bluetooth/BluetoothDevice.java;l\u003d1915;drc\u003d880ce2aa1aa49e5af6039e7f8bbc889d51926c8d\n\nthe check to isEnabled is a check to bluetooth being ON.\n\nAny other call to createBond while bluetooth is not ON is either a race or a direct call on the binder that is not supported and not wanted",
